    {
      "FieldName": "Text",
      "FieldValue": "<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\r\n<head><title></title></head>\r\n<body><span class=\"MOS-TVRMCG\" id=\"2bd76102-f797-43a8-93c6-7ca6876ca774\"></span><span class=\"MOS-TVRMCG\" id=\"a5bba0d7-f469-4968-b744-bcc870be3ef5\"></span><span class=\"MOS-TVRMCG\" id=\"6e378ef7-f977-4125-96b2-50a9d577d99d\"></span><span class=\"MOS-TVRMCG\" id=\"18d9649e-c0c9-4c43-85f6-416a27d1c204\"></span><span class=\"MOS-TVRMCG\" id=\"3ac59cc7-9fe2-49b2-8dfc-639a4dfc4ffe\"></span><br /><span id=\"BLACKLINE\"></span><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">MD&#160;SITUATIE&#160;NISTRU</span><span><br /><br /></span><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">NIVELUL&#160;NISTRULUI&#160;S-A&#160;STABILIZAT&#160;LA&#160;STAŢIA&#160;COSĂUŢI</span><span><br /><br /></span><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">INTRO:&#160;</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">Nivelul&#160;apei&#160;în&#160;zona&#160;stației&#160;de&#160;captare&#160;de&#160;la&#160;Cosăuți,&#160;care&#160;asigură&#160;aprovizionarea&#160;cu&#160;apă&#160;a&#160;municipiului&#160;Bălți&#160;și&#160;a&#160;altor&#160;localități&#160;din&#160;nordul&#160;r&#160;moldova,&#160;s-a&#160;stabilizat.&#160;Autoritățile&#160;precizează&#160;că&#160;există&#160;o&#160;rezervă&#160;de&#160;peste&#160;un&#160;metru&#160;până&#160;la&#160;nivelul&#160;minim&#160;necesar&#160;pentru&#160;funcționarea&#160;stației.&#160;În&#160;contextul&#160;crizei&#160;hidrologice,&#160;deputaţii&#160;din&#160;opoziţie&#160;au&#160;cerut&#160;audierea&#160;ministrului&#160;Gheorghe&#160;Hajder.</span><span><br /><br /></span><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">BETA</span><span><br /><br /></span><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">AMBIANŢĂ&#160;(brut&#160;vechi&#160;parlament&#160;ftp)</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">Parlamentul_RM_2026-10-02_11-07-28&#160;-&#160;00012</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">03.22&#160;-&#160;00:34</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">Să&#160;vină&#160;ministrul&#160;în&#160;faţă.&#160;Ţine&#160;de&#160;securitatea&#160;apei&#160;şi&#160;să&#160;explice&#160;exact&#160;situaţia&#160;de&#160;pe&#160;Nistru,&#160;pe&#160;Prut,&#160;localitate&#160;cu&#160;localitate.&#160;Ce&#160;se&#160;întâmplă&#160;şi&#160;ce&#160;a&#160;fost&#160;întreprins.&#160;</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">Parlamentul_RM_2026-10-02_11-07-28&#160;-&#160;00012</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">03:23&#160;-&#160;03:32</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">Domnule&#160;Grădinaru,&#160;doamna&#160;Ursu&#160;s-a&#160;adresat&#160;frumos&#160;cu&#160;o&#160;iniţiativă.&#160;Să&#160;îi&#160;spui:&#160;\"La&#160;culcare\",&#160;cumva&#160;nu&#160;e&#160;frumos.</span><span><br /><br /><br /><br /></span><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">TEXT:&#160;</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">Deputaţii&#160;susţin&#160;că,&#160;în&#160;localităţile&#160;de&#160;nord,&#160;riscul&#160;privind&#160;aprovizionarea&#160;cu&#160;apă&#160;este&#160;mai&#160;mic&#160;decât&#160;cel&#160;în&#160;zona&#160;Centru.</span><span><br /><br /></span><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">IGOR&#160;GROSU,&#160;preşedintele&#160;Parlamentului&#160;Republicii&#160;Moldova</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">614_4269</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">17:53&#160;-&#160;18:08</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">Problema&#160;principală&#160;în&#160;cazul&#160;Chişinăului&#160;e&#160;staţia:&#160;felul&#160;cum&#160;a&#160;fost&#160;proiectată&#160;staţia&#160;versus&#160;cum&#160;e&#160;la&#160;Soroca.&#160;chiar&#160;dacă&#160;nivelul&#160;apei&#160;a&#160;scăzut,&#160;felul&#160;cum&#160;e&#160;proiectată&#160;şi&#160;construită&#160;staţia,&#160;permite&#160;să&#160;folosim&#160;staţia&#160;chiar&#160;la&#160;un&#160;nivel&#160;mai&#160;scăzut.&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><span><br /><br /></span><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">SERGIU&#160;LAZARENCU,&#160;deputat&#160;PAS</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">614_4275</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">01.01&#160;-&#160;01:26</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">Din&#160;păcate&#160;nu&#160;avem&#160;precipitaţii&#160;destule&#160;şi&#160;astăzi&#160;toată&#160;cantitatea&#160;de&#160;apă&#160;care&#160;izvorăşte&#160;din&#160;munţii&#160;Carpaţi&#160;trece&#160;tranzit&#160;prin&#160;lacul&#160;de&#160;la&#160;Novodnistrovsk&#160;şi&#160;vine&#160;spre&#160;Chişinău.&#160;Chiar&#160;şi&#160;această&#160;cantitate&#160;mică&#160;ajunge&#160;pentru&#160;aprovizionarea&#160;locuitorilor&#160;Chişinău.&#160;Este&#160;important&#160;ca&#160;staţia&#160;de&#160;captare&#160;să&#160;o&#160;poată&#160;capta.&#160;Chiar&#160;şi&#160;30&#160;de&#160;metri&#160;cubi&#160;pe&#160;secundă&#160;ajunge&#160;pentru&#160;aprovizionarea&#160;cu&#160;apă&#160;a&#160;cetăţenilor.&#160;&#160;</span><span><br /><br /><br /></span><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">VASILE&#160;TARLEV,&#160;deputat&#160;neafiliat</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">614_4270</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">05:24&#160;&#160;-&#160;05:40</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">Situaţia&#160;pe&#160;care&#160;o&#160;avem&#160;azi&#160;e&#160;din&#160;vina&#160;neodaptării&#160;deciziilor&#160;corecte&#160;a&#160;autorităţilor.&#160;În&#160;primul&#160;rând,&#160;dacă&#160;nu&#160;vedeau&#160;o&#160;perspectivă&#160;ce&#160;ţine&#160;de&#160;de&#160;Nistru,&#160;urmau&#160;să&#160;întreprindă&#160;acţiuni&#160;urgente&#160;ca&#160;să&#160;avem&#160;apă&#160;de&#160;la&#160;Prut,&#160;de&#160;la&#160;Dunăre&#160;şi&#160;sondele&#160;arteziene.&#160;&#160;</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">&#160;</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">IGOR&#160;DODON,&#160;liderul&#160;PSRM</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">614_4268</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">06:23&#160;-&#160;06:40</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">Noi&#160;am&#160;insistat&#160;şi&#160;am&#160;semnat&#160;ca&#160;demarcarea&#160;frontierei&#160;să&#160;aibă&#160;loc&#160;pe&#160;centrul&#160;Nistrului.&#160;au&#160;venit&#160;guvernele&#160;proeuropene&#160;şi&#160;au&#160;cedat&#160;pe&#160;malul&#160;drept.&#160;de&#160;atunci&#160;au&#160;început&#160;toate&#160;problemele:&#160;construcţii&#160;suplimentare.&#160;De&#160;aceea,&#160;soluţia&#160;ar&#160;fi,&#160;dacă&#160;ucrainenii&#160;sunt&#160;prietenii&#160;noștri,&#160;să&#160;deverseze&#160;mai&#160;multă&#160;apă&#160;de&#160;la&#160;baraj.&#160;mai&#160;sus&#160;de&#160;baraj&#160;acolo&#160;totul&#160;este&#160;bine.&#160;</span><span><br /><br /><br /></span><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">TEXT:&#160;</span><br /><span xml:lang=\"ro-ro\">Autorităţile&#160;au&#160;anunţat&#160;că&#160;nivelul&#160;apei&#160;în&#160;lacul&#160;de&#160;acumulare&#160;Novodnistrovsk&#160;a&#160;coborât&#160;sub&#160;pragul&#160;critic&#160;de&#160;111&#160;metri,&#160;in&#160;timp&#160;ce&#160;nivelul&#160;normal&#160;este&#160;de&#160;121,5&#160;metri.&#160;Situația&#160;hidrologică&#160;severă&#160;afectează&#160;și&#160;râul&#160;Prut.&#160;Nivelul&#160;apei&#160;din&#160;lacul&#160;de&#160;acumulare&#160;Costești-Stânca&#160;a&#160;scăzut&#160;semnificativ&#160;în&#160;ultima&#160;lună,&#160;iar&#160;autoritățile&#160;au&#160;decis&#160;să&#160;reducă&#160;debitul&#160;de&#160;apă&#160;evacuat&#160;în&#160;râul&#160;Prut.</span><br /></body></html>"
    },
